      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so quiet now. i keep walking into the kitchen thinking i'll see him there or hear his nails on the floor but it's just... nothing. i don't even know why i'm bothering to wake up and do all this stuff every day. it feels like there's no point to any of it if the one thing that made the house feel alive is just gone.",
